{
  "key": 8323,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_1104_SC06R0301_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmmm... BURMY are an\n",
        "interesting example...\r",
        "They hint at how the environment can\n",
        "shape people’s personality."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1104_SC06R0301_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "You know about BURMY and how\n",
        "they come in different forms?\r",
        "Do you have all forms of that there\n",
        "BURMY?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1104_SC06R0301_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Aww, you don’t even have a single\n",
        "BURMY?\r",
        "You don’t like ’em?\n",
        "They’re kind of mooshy and cute!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1104_SC06R0301_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmm...\r",
        "It’d be cool if you had all the\n",
        "different-looking BURMY."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1104_SC06R0301_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Cool! That’s all the different kinds\n",
        "of BURMY! I feel giddy!\r",
        "Since I feel so giddy, take this!\n",
        "Go ahead, take it!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1104_SC06R0301_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Whoops, your Bag is crammed full!\n",
        "I’ll give this to you later."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1104_SC06R0301_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "You’re good!\n",
        "You’d make an awesome Bug Maniac!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}